<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's June iron, steel import prices down.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's June iron, steel import prices down.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's iron and steel import prices fell slightly in June from the previous month, the Association of Foreign Trading Agents of Korea (AFTAK) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Import prices of iron and steel were as follows:</p>
<p>(US$ per tonne on C&amp;F)</p>
<p> COMMODITY		 Origin     Jun	 May</p>
<p> Pig iron		  China	172	 172</p>
<p> Scrap iron		U.S.	 159	 156</p>
<p> Billet		    Japan	256	 256</p>
<p> Hot coil		  Japan	318	 330</p>
<p> Slab			Brazil     262	 262</p>
<p> Stainless hot coil    Japan    1,450     1,560</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
